# Camera access refused / failing: a non-zero Response only logs a warning. QUIRK: the shared connection stays in the
# "initializing" state, so sources created afterwards never ask the portal again and never stream. A failed AccessCamera call is
# logged unless it was cancelled.
unique_name :1.8
camera_load
new c1 pipewire-camera-source
response 1 "(2, {})"
new c2 pipewire-camera-source
size c2
camera_unload
new c3 pipewire-camera-source
finish 2 error failed "no camera portal"
camera_unload
new c4 pipewire-camera-source
finish 3 error cancelled "x"
